

>> usedMemory1 := 0.
>> usedMemory2 := 0.
>> usedMemory3 := 0.
>> usedMemory4 := 0.

Prograam faraay: 0.

>> a := Jokkalante ← ['hello'] ; ['world'] ; Dëgg ; Dara ; 666.
>> b := a dale: 2 guddaay: 2.
Génn bind: ( b boole: ['|'] ), bind: b waññ.

Prograam faaral-njaboot.
usedMemory1 := (Prograam xalaat ? 0).


a := Jokkalante ← ['hello'] ; ['world'] ; Dëgg ; Dara ; 666.
b := a dale: 2 guddaay: 2.
Génn bind: ( b boole: ['|'] ), bind: b waññ.


